{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"428a1ceb86217d6983965627cbd6cda1d60f40175303baf1d5fcc5133cf6b572","ja":"これで……ついに完成です。","zh":"这样一来……终于完成了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"384e4b45830ad2392f30ec82bf6cf6008c659f1b8b04d1d2e4c21ae02730410b","ja":"はい、あの時食べた味と全く同じです。\n……やったぞ。","zh":"是的，和那时候尝到的味道完全一样。\n……成功了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0f47c1f46f1a73cffbb092f50373e684437b29d3c20de09fa9009000db3f9a4f","ja":"あとは、仕事を終えたこのみが\n帰ってくるのを待つのみですが……。","zh":"接下来，就只等完成工作的木实\n回来了，但是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f28337456dade43f4aeef4c3d03e32e4c46918f065f79c8aea0ef5d56e561379","ja":"みんな、お疲れさま！\n実はね、みんなと一緒に食べようと思って……。","zh":"大家辛苦啦！\n其实啊，我想着和大家一起吃……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"68542c495619275f34d91aec2e368c45d6497c3849901ace4b7d4bd406529e82","ja":"あらっ？　いい匂いがするわね？\nなんだか懐かしい感じの……これって……？","zh":"哎呀？闻起来好香呢？\n总觉得有种让人怀念的感觉……这个是……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"e8aaaefea6deb102f62fe6d70d68da4f3794752b617395fcd46f518510590e58","ja":"この前のろけ地でいただいたお鍋を再現しました。\nこのみが食べたいと言っていたので。","zh":"之前在外景拍摄地吃到的火锅，我试着还原了一下。\n因为木实说想吃。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ed62530275e32daadd4bdd3b2fbacf21a43fd1398408b9cdf37690d7b3155272","ja":"……ええっ！\nもしかして、私のために作ってくれたの！？","zh":"……诶诶！\n难道说，这是特意为我做的吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"5d3b7f234169bc1d25c33b1b50fb2a19a503ddc6d9e2deae5177c873df070295","ja":"うん。このみさんには、\nいつもお世話になってるし。","zh":"嗯。平时一直受到\n木实姐的关照。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"02b910c7fc1b9dac93a292683fbdf053450355d3330bf551605c7496bd3ca29e","ja":"そのお礼をこめて、みんなで作ったの♪\n貴音さんたち、すっごくがんばってたんだよ！","zh":"为了表达谢意，大家一起做的哦♪\n贵音她们可努力了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"3b1eef33d1a8b73ae45529b28c666be06e8c2f4affc092a5a658a65bc7b89937","ja":"はい。ですが、その甲斐がありました。","zh":"是的。不过，这也算是有所回报了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"33d2046174663cd5d962765006dc639597eb6a093aa3d702dc1175d61a828457","ja":"貴音ちゃん、瑞希ちゃん、桃子ちゃん、育ちゃん、\n本当にありがとう！　すっごく嬉しいわ！","zh":"贵音、瑞希、桃子、育，\n真的很谢谢你们！我超级开心的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"dd087d0f0476e63dcda86e4e86070651043d238f4b359a9abeb1fabfc04233a8","ja":"ところで、先ほどこのみは何かを言いかけなかったで\nしょうか？　「みんなで一緒に」、と……？","zh":"话说回来，刚才木实是不是想说什么\n来着？比如“大家一起”之类的……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"1079419321792a73255c83f8889fcecaf26db9d2f1f6e0fc4ce6feee1548680e","ja":"ううん、何でもないわ。\nそれよりさっそく、いただきましょう！","zh":"没、没什么。\n不说这个了，赶紧趁热吃吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"6fbb24b171d8d5e763fec2db9715dd5da49c375f134e4f3b0216d4eebc051b3a","ja":"（みんなで食べようと思って、あの時の\nお鍋のセットを通販で取り寄せてたんだけど……）","zh":"（本来想和大家一起吃，便网购订了\n当时吃的那套火锅套餐的，可是……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1310.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"bbf840aeedf120c76c66b6abb44fde2c16ef903fc801eb3f2273b1e78a51daa1","ja":"（これは秘密にしておいた方が良いわね……うふふっ♪）","zh":"（这还是保密比较好呢……呵呵♪）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
